  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Primary Order Path",
      "items": [
        "1. Diner submits checkout on Next.js 16 App Router UI",
        "2. Handled by POST /api/orders (validating hours, PII, table/area)",
        "3. Dual-sync writes to orders (Live Queue) and OrderLedger (Immutable Archive)",
        "4. Synchronously emits 'new-order' via Socket.IO 4.8 server to Admin Cockpit",
        "5. Fires async Meta CAPI Purchase event and client-triggered Twilio WhatsApp"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Dual-Sync & Safe Purge Architecture",
      "items": [
        "Live Queue (`orders`) retains only active orders (Received, Preparing, Delivered, Cancelled)",
        "Immutable Archive (`orderledgers`) preserves 100% of historical order data across 5 compound indexes",
        "Safe Purge (/api/orders/purge-completed) guarantees ledger copy exists before removing from live queue",
        "Analytics and accounting reports query OrderLedger with fallback to orders"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Resilient Media Pipeline",
      "items": [
        "Singleton poison guard validates credentials before calling cloudinary.config()",
        "uploadToCloudinaryWithRetry handles transient drops with 90s timeout and 3-attempt exponential backoff",
        "Search API execution is guarded with 20s Promise.race fallback to Admin Resources API",
        "Next.js next/image serves AVIF/WebP formats with 1-year minimumCacheTTL"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Companion Deep-Dive Diagrams",
      "items": [
